{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42284","headline":"题碧岩亭赠孙尊师 · 徐铉","name":"题碧岩亭赠孙尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝境何人识，高亭万象含。\n凭轩临树杪，送目极天南。\n积霭生泉洞，归云锁石龛。\n丹霞披翠巘，白鸟带晴岚。\n仙去留虚室，龙归涨碧潭。\n幽岩君独爱，玄味我曾耽。\n世上愁何限，人间事久谙。\n终须脱羁鞅，来此会空谈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}